 "text": "Hi, how have you been? The simple and cheap way is to tape a band of tape across the back of the desk, so the cables sit on top. No problem. Taping a band of tape across the back of the desk, so the cables sit on top. Takes about five minutes and looks neat. The tape can be chipped off in a few minutes if you want tidy it up. Use a small box of some kind, maybe the kind games come in, and plug the charger into that. A short length of plastic shelf jar makes a good shelter. Push the plug in first, then the cable, so you can slide the jar on top.",
